  "summary": "Integrate 5 production-ready developer tools: shadcn/ui for UI components, Magic UI for animations, React Scan for performance monitoring, Upstash Rate Limit for rate limiting, and Sentry for error tracking. Each tool is feature-flagged and implemented incrementally with one commit per slice.",
  "principles": [
    "Commit-per-slice: every change gets its own commit",
    "Feature-flagged: each tool can be enabled/disabled independently",
    "Backward-compatible: existing functionality preserved",
    "Testable: every integration has tests",
    "Accessible: WCAG 2.1 AA compliance maintained"
  ],
